          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Periods repeat daily in local time. An end time earlier than its start is on the next day; gaps keep the current wallpaper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时段每天按本地时间重复。结束时间早于开始时间表示在次日结束；空档时保持当前壁纸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Periods repeat daily in local time. An end time earlier than its start is on the next day. The current wallpaper stays active when no period matches." : {
